# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout (every platform).
# The SSR emit embeds fixture whitespace verbatim, so a fixture's line endings become
# part of the generated output; pinning LF keeps the emit deterministic and the golden
# `.mjs` snapshots byte-identical on Windows, macOS and Linux alike.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-braces for the inputs and snapshots the golden test compares byte-for-byte.
*.fud text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
